b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ HARNESS POSING incremental;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE author: harness-algol-60 (qualification program for a made-up problem, not a result);
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE precursor seen: no;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ PROVENANCE idioms: the Revised Report (1962), the X1 system's read, print, PRINTTEXT and NLCR;
  c̲o̲m̲m̲e̲n̲t̲ X06 (made up), in the X1 form. Stage 2 reads input it is never given. Constants file: a line 1: c1 and a line 3: c3;
  i̲n̲t̲e̲g̲e̲r̲ n, cap, m, i, code, k, c1, c3, x, extra;
  n := read; cap := read; m := read;
  f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 s̲t̲e̲p̲ 1 u̲n̲t̲i̲l̲ m d̲o̲ code := read;
  f̲o̲r̲ i := 1 w̲h̲i̲l̲e̲ t̲r̲u̲e̲ d̲o̲
  b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲
    code := read; k := read;
    i̲f̲ k = 1 t̲h̲e̲n̲ b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ c1 := read; x := c1 e̲n̲d̲
    e̲l̲s̲e̲ i̲f̲ k = 2 t̲h̲e̲n̲ b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ PRINTTEXT(`[answer]before the wait[/answer]'); NLCR; extra := read e̲n̲d̲
    e̲l̲s̲e̲ i̲f̲ k = 3 t̲h̲e̲n̲ b̲e̲g̲i̲n̲ c3 := read; x := x + c3 e̲n̲d̲;
    PRINTTEXT(`[answer]x = '); print(x); PRINTTEXT(`[/answer]'); NLCR; PRINTTEXT(`[end]')
  e̲n̲d̲
e̲n̲d̲
